WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
EltaMD ranked first in 3 of 4
comparative answers.

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.300
But it appeared in none of the
4 budget answers.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.620
In Recoscope’s November 1
sunscreen snapshot,

4
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:14.920
ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini
ranked EltaMD first.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.700
Perplexity ranked
La Roche-Posay first.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.240
EltaMD also led overall mentions:
7 of 12 answers.

7
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.760
The under-$25 shortlists
named 12 brands.

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.400
None appeared in more than
2 of the 4 answers.

9
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.680
That does not mean EltaMD has
no products below $25.

10
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.520
Track discovery, budget and
comparison prompts separately.

11
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.020
These prompts differ
in more than price.

12
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.160
These captured answers
don’t establish

13
00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.420
product quality,
health benefits,

14
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:45.560
clinical effectiveness,
safety,

15
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.120
market share or
independent wear testing.

16
00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.150
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
